_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W9H2rE6-NZQQ7kNvwEJ00B_&_nc_oc=AdoI2hn6tc3LxB2mAUoqhL5EmMoeJqd-1zNkJ223_1pn2j6xbitmvMygV_VZTSyRgUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQATNPTfyaUrcd7ktSYbeajVzUM27MlmhiDx3aMhEKm5hQ&oe=6A621C7B"}, {"file_name": "S05.png", "id": "1438048874205504", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305443_1438048877538837_3306179061820485367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0anDu3bHFPgQ7kNvwH2zMEU&_nc_oc=AdooB_M0eek90V_cSBPU9HFNvopmbFy1W_fVhH0h1tVGjqoxc-htmiGtkJ-Hz5WdgeA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDXzRPe4cosH_kwDJQyszoWfvlTQmHzIeRNsXcZHgLWkA&oe=6A620788"}, {"file_name": "S04.png", "id": "1684349449365865", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_1684349452699198_4597294301797073543_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ckisHDflOgQ7kNvwFZI6-W&_nc_oc=AdqcmiFibrNm83zsxtyshLkOGIIaksTUNWSU2LKKvvSxyGGjwnG97PKjFOCblvTVFps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDiADj7fUlu2z84iUMjKtAO_BN4h0_AwkahbHpFVnru0A&oe=6A622863"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Squingle_Arcade_Cover_Video_Trailer.png", "id": "1909009776454210", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294644_1909009779787543_5789072338823332337_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SQuCUO4Wg8kQ7kNvwFsQChW&_nc_oc=AdpNaOul_xmbptksaWoCln8DowR26nW48bri29hNBtqqegiyTDeGu4X3uv09sWx6GLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDW6MqmY8pd6U_cy5aOh4JqwWSdqbjdHlxh64n6eYppAQ&oe=6A62213B"}, "display_name": "Squingle Arcade", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Relax", "Casual", "MR", "Arcade"], "long_description": "# **RELAX, FLOW, PLAY** \n# Enter SQUINGLE ARCADE, the ultimate free-to-play cosmic arcade-puzzle!\n\nGuide twin revolving orbs through  glass-like 3D mazes that twist, turn, and pulse with life. Defeat hypnotic enemies, find secret paths, and collect every color orb.\n{2430420050801042}\n{1703175704198554}\n{842763658413795}\n\n**Dive into the highest-rated VR puzzle universe!** Squingle Arcade takes the critically acclaimed original and supercharges it with high-stakes arcade action.\n\nInspired by the precision of classics like Kururin and the visual splendor of Tetris Effect, Squingle Arcade is a multisensory journey through cosmic transcendence.\n\n# KEY FEATURES\n\n\u2022 **Mind-Bending Levels:** Navigate increasingly complex Squingles, morphing sculptures that challenge your spatial awareness and manual dexterity.\n\n\u2022 **Competitive Arcade Mode:** Race in a true asynchronous multiplayer mode against other players and reach the top of the leaderboards.\n{2373978329747747}\n\u2022 **Relax or Rush:** Play at your own pace in a meditative Flow state or tackle Challenge Mode for an intense time-trial experience.\n\n\u2022 **Optional Mixed Reality Immersion:** Watch as cosmic structures emanate from your real-world walls.\n{1625985945298599}\n\u2022 **Optional Hand Tracking:** Use your hands to guide the orbs with fluid, natural movements, or stick with Touch controllers for haptic-enhanced precision.\n\n\u2022 **Room-Scale & Sitting Support:** Play at any scale, from a miniature desk-sized maze to a room-filling cosmic structure that engages your whole body.\n\n\n# Join our Discord to be part of the community and keep up with the news:\nhttps://discord.com/invite/yUf7TwZ7Me", "short_description": "Experience the mystical VR/MR evolution of Squingle with its new FREE-TO-PLAY title: Squingle Arcade! Guide twin orbs through 60 iridescent, morphing 3D mazes that pulse in your room. Blending the classics of Japanese Arcade with mind-blowing puzzles, use hand tracking to master \"Squingles\" and top global leaderboards. An otherworldly, multisensory journey through cosmic evolution."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_o